<</if>>

:: Racecourse Rig Stimulant Success
<<effects>>
<<set _horse to setup.horserace.getHorse($horserace.rigTargetId)>>
<<print _horse.name>> drinks a lot of water, then shakes <<raceit its>> head and hits the ground with a front hoof. <<raceit Its>> ears point forward, and <<raceit it>> keeps looking at every person who moves nearby.
<br><br>
<<run setup.horserace.resolveRigAction("stimulate_own", _horse.id, true)>>
<<riggingFooter>>

:: Racecourse Rig Stimulant Caught
<<effects>>
<<set _horse to setup.horserace.getHorse($horserace.rigTargetId)>>
The handler walks back before you're done.
<br><br>
You move away from the bucket and put a hand on the <<racehorse>>'s neck, pretending you only came to pet <<raceit itobj>>. The water in the bucket still looks cloudy.<<gstress>><<stress 4>>
<br><br>
<<run setup.horserace.resolveRigAction("stimulate_own", _horse.id, false)>>
<<riggingFooter>>

:: Racecourse Rig Bribe Money
<<effects>>
<<set _action to setup.horserace.getRigAction("bribe_money")>>
<<set _horse to setup.horserace.getHorse($horserace.rigTargetId)>>
<<if !_horse or $horserace.phase isnot "betting">>
	<<link [[Return to the racecourse|Racecourse]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	You find the <<person>> sitting on <<print _horse.name>> beside the small platform riders use to get onto their <<racehorses>>. <<Hes>> checking the straps that hold <<his>> feet in place. You walk over to speak to <<him>>.
	<br><br>
	"I'll give you two hundred now and another three hundred after the race if you make <<print _horse.name>> finish behind the others," you say. The rider stays quiet, watching you. <<He>> hasn't agreed yet, but <<he>> hasn't told you to leave either.
	<br><br>
	<<set $horserace.rigSuccessPassage to "Racecourse Rig Bribe Money Success">>
	<<set $horserace.rigCaughtPassage to "Racecourse Rig Bribe Money Caught">>
	<<run setup.horserace.startRigMinigame("bribe_money")>>
	<<link [[Start|Racecourse Rig Minigame]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Racecourse Rig Bribe Money Success
<<effects>>
<<set _action to setup.horserace.getRigAction("bribe_money")>>
<<set _horse to setup.horserace.getHorse($horserace.rigTargetId)>>
The rider looks around to make sure nobody is watching, then holds out a hand.
<br><br>
You hand <<him>> the money. <<He>> quickly puts it in <<his>> pocket and goes back to checking the straps near <<his>> feet, pretending that nothing happened.
<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<set $money to $money - setup.horserace.rigCostInternal(_action)>>
<<run setup.horserace.resolveRigAction("bribe_money", _horse.id, true)>>
<<riggingFooter>>

:: Racecourse Rig Bribe Money Caught
<<effects>>
<<set _horse to setup.horserace.getHorse($horserace.rigTargetId)>>
<<He>> looks at the money, then at you, and shakes <<his>> head.
<br><br>
"I'm not getting banned from racing for this," <<he>> says loudly enough for a nearby worker to hear.<<ggstress>><<stress 8>>
<br><br>
<<run setup.horserace.resolveRigAction("bribe_money", _horse.id, false)>>
<<riggingFooter>>

:: Racecourse Rig Sabotage Tack
<<effects>>
<<set _horse to setup.horserace.getHorse($horserace.rigTargetId)>>
<<if !_horse or $horserace.phase isnot "betting">>
	<<link [[Return to the racecourse|Racecourse]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	You find <<print _horse.name>>'s riding equipment on a fence outside the stall. The saddle, which the rider sits on, is beside the straps used to control the <<racehorse>>. The worker looking after <<raceit itobj>>, a <<person>>, has gone to get some water.
	<br><br>
	You go over to the saddle and crouch beside it. You find a strap that helps hold the saddle on the <<racehorse>> and begin damaging it where someone might not notice.
	<br><br>
	<<set $horserace.rigSuccessPassage to "Racecourse Rig Sabotage Tack Success">>
	<<set $horserace.rigCaughtPassage to "Racecourse Rig Sabotage Tack Caught">>
	<<run setup.horserace.startRigMinigame("sabotage_equipment")>>
	<<link [[Start|Racecourse Rig Minigame]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Racecourse Rig Sabotage Tack Success
<<effects>>
<<set _horse to setup.horserace.getHorse($horserace.rigTargetId)>>
You finish damaging the strap. It still looks normal from a short distance away, but it is now weak enough to break when the <<racehorse>> starts moving.
<br><br>
<<run setup.horserace.resolveRigAction("sabotage_equipment", _horse.id, true)>>
<<riggingFooter>>

:: Racecourse Rig Sabotage Tack Caught
<<effects>>
<<set _horse to setup.horserace.getHorse($horserace.rigTargetId)>>
You hear someone coming back along the path and quickly move your hand away from the strap.
<br><br>
You stand up and put your hands in your pockets just before the worker comes around the corner carrying a bucket of water.
<<gstress>><<stress 4>>
<br><br>
<<run setup.horserace.resolveRigAction("sabotage_equipment", _horse.id, false)>>
<<riggingFooter>>

:: Racecourse Rig Encourage Horse
<<effects>>
<<set _horse to setup.horserace.getHorse($horserace.rigTargetId)>>
<<if !_horse or $horserace.phase isnot "betting">>
	<<link [[Return to the racecourse|Racecourse]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	A <<persons>> working two stalls down, close enough to hear you if you make too much noise.
	You step into <<print _horse.name>>'s stall and stroke the side of <<raceit its>> neck.
	The <<racehorse>> turns <<raceit its>> head towards you, then stays still as you continue.
	<br><br>
	Your hand moves farther down <<raceit its>> side and along <<raceit its>> flank. The <<racehorse>> shifts <<raceit its>> weight and lifts <<raceit its>> tail,
	making you stop and check whether the <<person>> nearby has noticed.<<deviancy2>>
	<<set $horserace.rigSuccessPassage to "Racecourse Rig Encourage Horse Success">>
	<<set $horserace.rigCaughtPassage to "Racecourse Rig Encourage Horse Caught">>
	<<run setup.horserace.startRigMinigame("encourage_own")>>
	<<link [[Start|Racecourse Rig Minigame]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Racecourse Rig Encourage Horse Success
<<effects>>
