:: Racecourse Horse Sex Finish
<<effects>>
<<set _horse to setup.horserace.getHorse($horserace.rigTargetId)>>
<<if $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>
	<<raceit It>> backs off and settles, still breathing hard. You get your clothes straight and step out of the stall.
	Nobody in the yard is looking your way. <<clotheson>>
	<<if _horse>>
		<<print _horse.name>> stands calmer than before, ready for the race.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<run setup.horserace.resolveRigAction("encourage_own", _horse.id, true)>>
<<else>>
	<<if $finish is 1>><<encounterEndViolence>><</if>>
	The <<racehorse>> jerks sideways, knocking over a bucket. Someone two stalls down calls out to ask what's going on.
	You step back quickly.<<gstress>><<stress 4>><<garousal>><<arousal 40>>
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>> you climb to your feet.
	<<run setup.horserace.resolveRigAction("encourage_own", _horse.id, false)>>
<</if>>
<<endcombat>>
