:: Racecourse Rig Bribe Rider
<<effects>>
<<set _action to setup.horserace.getRigAction("bribe_sex")>>
<<set _horse to setup.horserace.getHorse($horserace.rigTargetId)>>
<<if !_horse or $horserace.phase isnot "betting">>
	<<link [[Return to the racecourse|Racecourse]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	You find the <<person>> who is going to ride <<print _horse.name>> standing alone behind the vehicle used to transport the <<racehorses>>. <<Hes>> checking a stopwatch and looks up when you approach.
	<br><br>
	"I want <<print _horse.name>> to win today," you say. "I can give you something in return if you help."
	<br><br>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to _action.difficulty>>
	<<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
	<<set _success to $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if _success>>
		<<He>> looks at you, then checks the path beside the stables to make sure nobody is coming. "All right, what are you offering?" <<he>> asks.
		<br><br>
		<<link "Offer yourself" "Racecourse Rig Bribe Rider Sex">><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> laughs and shakes <<his>> head. "I'm not risking my job for that," <<he>> says, then walks away before you can answer.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
		<br><br>
		<<run setup.horserace.resolveRigAction("bribe_sex", _horse.id, false)>>
		<<riggingFooter>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

